From: IllyasvielEin
Subject: [PATCH] RC01: reap dae before runtime cleanup and keep source updates

Based on kenzok8/openwrt-daede 3520a79bd9c68843801dc89d7d6e155d2c43c833.
The guard's signal/reap ordering follows that project's daed-guard.
Retain upstream copyright, licenses, and source provenance.

